      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "She understood exactly what he was suffering from, but entirely disagreed with his idea. In order to calm him down and settle his problem, she talked with him face to face and swapped a series of learning tips with him. The items she set down helped him find the highway to studying English well.",
        "zh": "她完全理解他的苦恼，但十分反对他的想法。为了让他冷静下来、解决问题，她与他面对面地交谈，分享了一系列学习技巧。她记下的这些要点帮助他找到了捷径，通向学好英语的道路。",
        "start": 90.31333333333333,
